---
const blocks = [
  {
    label: "Drift",
    name: "Your denoiser",
    body: "Any callable (X, A, t) → (f_X, f_A). Real networks or simplified stand-ins.",
  },
  {
    label: "DVS",
    name: "Drift Variation Score",
    body: "EMA-smoothed variation of the drift, scaled by a power-law rule into a timestep.",
  },
  {
    label: "Solver",
    name: "Euler-Maruyama · Heun",
    body: "First- or second-order SDE step with shared diffusion noise g(t) · √dt.",
  },
  {
    label: "Output",
    name: "X_T, A_T, info",
    body: "Sample features, adjacency, and per-step history (steps, times, dt_k).",
  },
];
---

<section class="relative py-24 sm:py-32" id="architecture">
  <div class="container-x">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
      <p class="eyebrow justify-center">
        <span class="h-px w-6 bg-aurora-300"></span>
        Architecture
        <span class="h-px w-6 bg-aurora-300"></span>
      </p>
      <h2 class="display mt-5 text-display-lg text-ink-50">
        One loop. Clean separation of concerns.
      </h2>
      <p class="lead mx-auto mt-5 max-w-xl">
        The adaptive controller (DVS, EMA, power-law scaling) is fully decoupled
        from the SDE solver and the denoiser network. Drop in any of the three
        without touching the others.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {
          blocks.map((b, i) => (
            <div
              class="surface-strong relative rounded-2xl p-6"
             
             -delay={i + 1}
            >
              <span class="eyebrow !text-aurora-300">{b.label}</span>
              <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink-50">
                {b.name}
              </h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-300">{b.body}</p>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>

      <!-- Data flow diagram -->
      <div class="surface-strong mt-6 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8">
        <p class="eyebrow">Sampler loop · per step</p>
        <div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-2 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto_1fr_auto_1fr_auto_1fr]">
          <div class="surface rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-center">
            <div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-400">drift</div>
            <div class="font-mono text-sm text-ink-100">(X, A, t) → f_X, f_A</div>
          </div>
          <div class="hidden text-center text-ink-500 lg:block">→</div>
          <div class="surface rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-center">
            <div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-400">DVS</div>
            <div class="font-mono text-sm text-ink-100">v_x, v_a = DVS(f_X, f_A)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="hidden text-center text-ink-500 lg:block">→</div>
          <div class="surface rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-center">
            <div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-400">step</div>
            <div class="font-mono text-sm text-ink-100">dt = min(dt_x, dt_a)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="hidden text-center text-ink-500 lg:block">→</div>
          <div class="surface rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-center">
            <div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-400">integrate</div>
            <div class="font-mono text-sm text-ink-100">X, A = SOLVERS[name](…)</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>